OL,3,GNEWSABody of man found after
OL,4,AKinlochleven house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a man has been found inside
OL,7,Fa Highland home after blaze broke out
OL,8,Fon Tuesday.
OL,10,FPolice said a fire was reported at a
OL,11,Fproperty on Leven Road in Kinlochleven
OL,12,Fat about 11:00 on Tuesday.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended, the road
OL,15,Fwas closed and a number of neighbouring
OL,16,Fproperties were evacuated.
OL,18,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,19,Fsaid six appliances and two-high reach
OL,20,Fvehicles were sent to the scene and the
OL,21,Ffire was extinguished.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
